{"sections":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS iOS is exposed through an open source Swift Package hosted on GitHub, and provides several libraries for your needs."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"These libraries help to split products and make users able to select only what they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI is the only official supported framework for Apple platforms."}]}],"chapter":"Import of the Swift Package and choose its libraries","title":"Swift Package integration","image":"ic_unified_ds.png","projectFiles":"OUDS-Discovery-Tutorial.zip","backgroundImage":"ic_unified_ds.png","estimatedTimeInMinutes":10,"kind":"hero","xcodeRequirement":"Xcode 27.1"},{"kind":"tasks","tasks":[{"stepsSection":[{"runtimePreview":null,"code":null,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Using Xcode, in your ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"project package dependencies"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", add a new ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"dependency"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Search with the GitHub repository URL (https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios), and select the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"ouds-ios"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" dependency.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You can then choose the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"dependency rule"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" you want.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To know which version you need, you can have a look on the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki\/01-%E2%80%90-Available-API"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and also the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/releases"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Let’s say you will use some beta version today, e.g. the version 3.0.0-beta.8","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"caption":[],"type":"step","media":"tutorial-discovery-1-ouds-swift-package.png"},{"runtimePreview":null,"code":null,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Once you downloaded the package, you will see several libraries are available.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"They can be embedded inside your ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"target"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" libraries.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Things are separated to let users integrate only what they need and embed the bare minimum of content.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesContract"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" library provides the main elements like the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"text":". The theme contract is defined inside it.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesOrange"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Orange products, and contains also assets and all tokens for this theme.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesSosh"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Sosh products, and contains also assets and all tokens for this theme.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesWireframe"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Wireframe theme, which is a theme dedicated to mockups and prototypes.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSThemesOrangeCompact"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" provides the theme implementation for the Orange products but with constraints of sizes and spaces.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSComponents"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" contains the SwiftUI OUDS components defined with the Figma specifications, and also useful view modifers.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSTokensRaw"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSTokensSemantic"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSTokensComponents"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" are libraries defining and providing the tokens for low level (raw),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"middle level (semantic) or component levels (high level).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSModules"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is for modules or rich components with extra logic.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSFoundations"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is dedicated to some utilities and shared logic.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Add for example only the umbrella product merging all products mentioned above: ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSSwiftUI"}],"type":"emphasis"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"step","media":"tutorial-discovery-1-ouds-libraries.png"}],"anchor":"Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries","title":"Import the Swift Package and the libraries","contentSection":[{"mediaPosition":"trailing","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS for iOS is an open source Swift Package available on GitHub under MIT license.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The package and the libraries must be added through Xcode.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"contentAndMedia"}]}]},{"kind":"assessments","assessments":[{"choices":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"I can contribute to OUDS using pull request","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":true,"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS is open source, under MIT license, and hosted on GitHub. Of course you can contribute!","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS supports officialy all Apple OS like visionOS, tvOS, watchOS, iPadOS, iOS and also CarPlay.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":false,"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The main supported targets are iOS \/ iPadOS. However we do our best to support macOS, visionOS, tvOS and watchOS.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"CarPlay specific cases are not scoped yet.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS provides UIKit components","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":false,"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS supports only SwiftUI.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"title":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Which of these choices is correct?"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"multiple-choice","content":[]},{"choices":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Some of the available products depending to my needs, or only ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSwiftUI"},{"text":" if I am very lazy and don’t care about my app size.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":true,"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can import all products provided by the Swift Package, and tailor your choice to keep only the ones needed.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Even if we recommend to choose only the atomic products you need, the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSwiftUI"},{"text":" product wraps all of them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"None, only the Swift package dependency matter.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"isCorrect":false,"justification":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You need to chose the products the Swift package provides.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"title":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Which imports of the OUDS Swift Package products can I choose?"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"multiple-choice","content":[]}],"anchor":"Check-Your-Understanding"},{"action":{"overridingTitle":"Get started","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"text":"Get started","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},"kind":"callToAction","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The theme is exposed as one object which will be injected inside your SwiftUI view."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The theme provides all tokens which defines in the end the rendering of everything."}],"title":"Instanciate and inject a theme","featuredEyebrow":"Tutorial"}],"metadata":{"role":"project","category":"Orange Unified Design System","categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","title":"Swift Package integration"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-libraries"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"modules":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Import-of-the-Swift-Package-and-choose-its-libraries","projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-libraries","sections":[{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-libraries#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries"},{"kind":"assessment","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutoria