onents increase the identity of your apps, it is not enough. Typography, fonts and tokens are here to improve that.","type":"text"}],"estimatedTime":"30min"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)/Richer-and-more-original-components-of-OUDS":{"kind":"article","title":"Richer and more original components of OUDS","type":"topic","url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(discovery)\/richer-and-more-original-components-of-ouds","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Richer-and-more-original-components-of-OUDS","abstract":[]},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-libraries":{"kind":"project","title":"Swift Package integration","type":"topic","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-libraries","role":"project","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-libraries","abstract":[{"text":"OUDS iOS is exposed through an open source Swift Package hosted on GitHub, and provides several libraries for your needs.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"These libraries help to split products and make users able to select only what they need.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"SwiftUI is the only official supported framework for Apple platforms.","type":"text"}],"estimatedTime":"10min"},"Xcode 27.1":{"identifier":"Xcode 27.1","type":"xcodeRequirement","url":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/download\/","title":"Xcode 27.1"},"https://github.com/Orange-OpenSource/ouds-ios/wiki/01-%E2%80%90-Available-API":{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki\/01-%E2%80%90-Available-API","type":"link","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki\/01-%E2%80%90-Available-API","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"available API list","type":"text"}],"title":"available API list"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutor